{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>Between</b> — It is not proper to weep in the house of HaShem, in the sanctuary before Him." "<b>For a reproach</b> — famine." "<b>A byword among the nations</b> — For those who flee from famine will come to them, and if they come to them, they have no strength to fight."], :book :joel, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Joel -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/yoel"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:06:32.536353648Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}